            "Within 30–60 minutes of IV infusion, 75–80% of an isotonic crystalloid redistributes from the intravascular space into the interstitial fluid.",
            "Lactated Ringer's Solution contains sodium lactate, which is converted to bicarbonate by hepatocytes, providing an alkalinizing effect.",
